  "tagline": "Enterprise multi-model database for XML, JSON and RDF with built-in search and semantic RAG.",
  "description": "MarkLogic Server is an enterprise database that stores XML, JSON, text, binary and RDF triples together and indexes everything for search out of the box. It is queried with XQuery, server-side JavaScript, SPARQL, SQL or the Optic API. It combines ACID transactions, element-level security and point-in-time queries with a universal index that makes full-text and structured search fast, which is why publishers, government agencies and financial institutions use it for data hubs. Progress Software acquired MarkLogic in 2023. Version 12 added native vector search and graph RAG, and 12.1.0 shipped in September 2026.",
